### Phase 3: Core Java for Backend (Critical)

> **Depth Level:** `Interview + Production`
> **Time Estimate:** 3–4 weeks

#### Topics

- **Exception Handling** — try/catch/finally, checked vs unchecked, custom exceptions, `throws`
- **Collections Framework** — List, Set, Map, Queue and their implementations
- **Generics** — type parameters, bounded wildcards (`<T extends Comparable<T>>`)
